# Lumine Mobile — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values before running on a device.
# .env is gitignored — never commit real values.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Backend API URL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# On Android emulator: use http://10.0.2.2:8000 (emulator maps this to host)
# On physical device or Expo Go: use your REAL Windows WiFi IP.
#
# ⚠️  WSL2 WARNING: Do NOT use the IP from `ip route show` in WSL2.
#     That gives a virtual internal address (172.19.x.x or 172.20.x.x)
#     that only exists inside the computer — a physical phone on WiFi
#     cannot reach it at all.
#
#     Instead, run this in Windows PowerShell (not WSL2):
#       ipconfig
#     Look for: Wireless LAN adapter Wi-Fi → IPv4 Address
#     It will look like 192.168.x.x — that is the correct IP.
#
# Docker: make sure port 8000 is exposed (it is, in docker-compose.yml)
#
# Example: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.35:8000
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://YOUR_WINDOWS_WIFI_IP:8000
